# Keep one line ending in the repository and on checkout: the shell scripts here
# have to run on Linux/macOS and under Git Bash on Windows, where a stray CR
# breaks the shebang and every `case` statement.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf

# Raster assets must not be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.zip binary